{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/703","id":4737134587,"node_id":"PR_kwDORnQJEs8AAAABGlrv-w","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/703","diff_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/703.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/703.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/703","number":703,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"test(money): coach Money fix-round specs for B-674-13/14 and B-676-5 (split M5 of #641)","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Tier:** T4 (money path). **Why:** M5 coach Money fix-round tests (tests only): the send-time retry admission and fail-closed Stripe reversal list fixes in M1 #674 (B-674-13, B-674-14) and the billed-evidence MRR fix in M3 #676 (B-676-5). Round 5 adds the reversal-slot specs for B-CM6-1 and B-CM7-1 (#674) and the live refund reversal concurrency spec with its CI step (moved from #674 for size). **T4 trigger scan:** tests only (refunds, chargebacks, head-coach transfer reversals, recurring metrics); no runtime change. **T3 trigger scan:** none beyond T4. **Bounded T1:** no. **Canonical builder:** Claude Opus 5.5 (B-CM9-120, agent 120; B-CM7-120, agent 120; earlier rounds B-CM6-119, B-CM5-119, agent 119). **Parent owner:** #641 split stack (M1 #674 -> M3 #676 -> M4 #677 -> M5). **Acceptance evidence:** failing-before CI-lane runs (no fix) and after runs at the fixed heads, below. **Promotion triggers:** none (already T4).\n\nTests-only piece on the M4 #677 branch. M1 #674 (2,965 lines at round 5), M3 #676 (2,984) and M4 #677 (2,915) have no room for these specs under the 3,000-line ceiling they are grandfathered at, so the new tests live here. Size: +953/-0 = 953 changed lines at round 5 (under the 1,500 limit for new PRs). Lands with the stack (merge guide rule 11); never alone.\n\n- `test/refund-reversal-send-time.spec.ts` (9 cases): B-674-13 refund sweep admission at the time of each send (long run; window crossed by one second between selection and send; in-window control with the send-time attempt stamp; paging control); B-674-14 incomplete reversal lists (has_more with an empty page; non-empty page then no progress; owner reconcile closed 503 `TRANSFER_REVERSALS_LIST_INCOMPLETE`; complete two-page and complete empty-list controls).\n- `test/refund-reversal-first-pass.spec.ts` (2 cases): C-674-12 (#674 8cc17809, same lines as B-674-13) overlapping deliveries of one success date every posting at the refund's posted_at, whichever wins the head-coach record; control: a redelivery 2 h after a failed first attempt posts the head share then. Failing before: [run 37230310550](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37230310550).\n- `test/coach-money-billed-mrr.spec.ts` (6 cases): B-676-5 a trial whose first invoice fails (real `CheckoutWebhookHandlerService` writer) is neither MRR nor paying; billed past_due renewal, first paid conversion, active trial, canceled never-billed, mixed client; exported `BILLED_WHERE` (C-673-3).\n\nFailing-before: [run 37229228865](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37229228865) (M1 cases, no fix: 6/9 red by assertion; the paging, two-page and complete-empty controls green) and [run 37229475145](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37229475145) (M3 cases, no fix: 4/6 red by assertion, 2 controls green). After: [run 37230321895](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37230321895) (#674 8cc17809) and [run 37230404105](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37230404105) (#676 ecaf75fd), all new specs green.\n\n## Fix rounds\n\n| Round | Job | Head | Closes | Size |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 0 | opened (B-CM5-119, agent 119) | `73fa700c` -> `d60a6d58` | tests for B-674-13, B-674-14, C-674-12 (#674) and B-676-5 (#676); restack on #677 6340993b | 460 |\n| 5 | B-CM7-120, agent 120 (finishes B-CM6-119) | `88940c3f` | send-time controls (e8db67f5), live concurrency spec + CI step moved from #674 (bf29ab18, ad21125a), B-CM6-1 spec (b16021ab) (B-CM6-119); restack on #677 b17888ab (ba709e05); B-CM7-1 spec (88940c3f) | 953 |\n| 6 | B-CM9-120, agent 120 | `ebde8b3b` | restack on #677 e3940bd0 (244892a7, merge-only); recovery spec for B-674-1, B-674-15, B-674-16 (ebde8b3b) | 1,291 |\n\n\n","created_at":"2026-10-04T19:50:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T19:52:59Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f57557fca93e92b56347634a4bde4ef7242e5d9f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11278565662,"node_id":"LA_kwDORnQJEs8AAAACoEFBHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growt